(7053849, 1072947, 128323, '<td valign="top">My only nit-pick is that your left glass is a little OOF, but I''d love to know how you managed this! My wild guess is that this is blue jello or gel of some kind.  Nice photo!</td>', 'My only nit-pick is that your left glass is a little OOF, but I''d love to know how you managed this! My wild guess is that this is blue jello or gel of some kind.  Nice photo!', '2013-06-21 07:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
