(7055130, 1072977, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely lovely. I don''t find it to meet the challenge, but still beautiful.</td>', 'This is absolutely lovely. I don''t find it to meet the challenge, but still beautiful.', '2013-06-25 21:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055131, 1072994, 114225, '<td valign="top">A little contrast could go a long way to making this image nicer.</td>', 'A little contrast could go a long way to making this image nicer.', '2013-06-25 21:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055132, 1073014, 114225, '<td valign="top">I definitely enjoy the way the processing works with the light.</td>', 'I definitely enjoy the way the processing works with the light.', '2013-06-25 21:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7055134, 1072947, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea.<br/>To me, this lacks pop. First is the contrast. The light doesn''t provide a nice natural contrast, which makes the background and foreground blend too much (even with the depth of field). Second is the colors. I really wish that blue stood out more. Finally, the left glass is dirty, those types of little things can really hurt an image.</td>', 'Very cute idea.To me, this lacks pop. First is the contrast. The light doesn''t provide a nice natural contrast, which makes the background and foreground blend too much (even with the depth of field). Second is the colors. I really wish that blue stood out more. Finally, the left glass is dirty, those types of little things can really hurt an image.', '2013-06-25 21:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
