(7060231, 1072991, 61396, '<td valign="top">I actually like your choice of the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75618" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">odriew</a> color palette.</td>', 'I actually like your choice of the  odriew color palette.', '2013-07-03 12:29:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7060577, 1072559, 131038, '<td valign="top">???"anyone could take this anytime", MMMMMM maybe not!<br/> <br/>Sometimes you see something that speaks to you and so you do your best to capture it, sometimes you work to produce an image that will speak to others. I am not sure which, or how much of each, this is but I like it.  <br/> <br/>Some good use of solid composition principals, great balance of colour, contrast, textures and symbolism both Tactile and sensual perceptual. Either great luck with time of day for the shadow, or applaudable patience for waiting, overall I like this image allot, Great job. <br/> <br/>Maybe anybody could have taken this shot, I''m glad You did! <br/> <br/>Good Eye!<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', '???"anyone could take this anytime", MMMMMM maybe not! Sometimes you see something that speaks to you and so you do your best to capture it, sometimes you work to produce an image that will speak to others. I am not sure which, or how much of each, this is but I like it.   Some good use of solid composition principals, great balance of colour, contrast, textures and symbolism both Tactile and sensual perceptual. Either great luck with time of day for the shadow, or applaudable patience for waiting, overall I like this image allot, Great job.  Maybe anybody could have taken this shot, I''m glad You did!  Good Eye!  ', '2013-07-04 11:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
